{"parentUuid":"63be17c6-c65b-41e5-8d37-47a9e39a0033","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"883c624f-30a6-4824-9d57-63b7ce2e1fab","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RBsYBkxkeEFT7TUAGVoVaR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# entire-agent-omp\n2\t\n3\tExternal agent binary that teaches the [Entire CLI](https://github.com/entireio/cli) how to work with [Pi](https://pi.dev), the AI coding agent.\n4\t\n5\t## Capabilities\n6\t\n7\t| Capability | Status |\n8\t|-----------|--------|\n9\t| hooks | Yes — TypeScript extension in `.omp/extensions/entire/` |\n10\t| transcript_analyzer | Yes — parses JSONL session files for prompts, files, summary |\n11\t| token_calculator | Yes — sums token usage from assistant messages |\n12\t| compact_transcript | Yes — emits Entire compact transcript JSONL for checkpoints v2 |\n13\t\n14\t## Installation\n15\t\n16\tBuild the binary and place it on your `PATH`:\n17\t\n18\t```bash\n19\tcd agents/entire-agent-omp\n20\tgo build -o entire-agent-omp ./cmd/entire-agent-omp\n21\tcp entire-agent-omp /usr/local/bin/\n22\t```\n23\t\n24\tOr use mise:\n25\t\n26\t```bash\n27\tcd agents/entire-agent-omp\n28\tmise run build\n29\t```\n30\t\n31\t## Prerequisites\n32\t\n33\t- [Pi](https://pi.dev) CLI installed (`omp` on PATH)\n34\t- An LLM provider API key configured for Pi (e.g., `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`)\n35\t\n36\t## How It Works\n37\t\n38\t### Hooks\n39\t\n40\t`install-hooks` creates a TypeScript extension at `.omp/extensions/entire/index.ts` that intercepts Pi lifecycle events and forwards them to `entire agent hook pi <event>`:\n41\t\n42\t| Pi Event | Protocol Event |\n43\t|----------|---------------|\n44\t| `session_start` | SessionStart (type 1) |\n45\t| `before_agent_start` | TurnStart (type 2) |\n46\t| `agent_end` | TurnEnd (type 3) |\n47\t| `session_shutdown` | (cleanup, no protocol event) |\n48\t\n49\t### Transcripts\n50\t\n51\tPi stores sessions as JSONL files at `~/.omp/agent/sessions/<encoded-path>/`. The binary reads these directly for transcript analysis, extracting:\n52\t\n53\t- Modified files from `write` and `edit` tool calls\n54\t- User prompts from `role: \"user\"` messages\n55\t- Summary from the last assistant text response\n56\t- Token usage from assistant message `usage` fields\n57\t\n58\t### Session Management\n59\t\n60\tSession files are cached in `.entire/tmp/<session-id>.json` as required by the Entire protocol. The session ID is the UUID from the Pi session filename.\n61\t\n62\t## Development\n63\t\n64\t```bash\n65\t# Build\n66\tgo build -o entire-agent-omp ./cmd/entire-agent-omp\n67\t\n68\t# Unit tests\n69\tgo test ./...\n70\t\n71\t# Protocol compliance\n72\texternal-agents-tests verify ./entire-agent-omp\n73\t\n74\t# E2E lifecycle tests (requires entire CLI and pi on PATH)\n75\tcd ../../\n76\tE2E_AGENT=omp mise run test:e2e\n77\t```\n78\t"}]},"uuid":"e4831538-bda0-49d8-a925-12a5c46a6f2a","timestamp":"2026-04-30T03:14:02.544Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/georgf/src/entireio/external-agents/agents/entire-agent-omp/README.md","content":"# entire-agent-omp\n\nExternal agent binary that teaches the [Entire CLI](https://github.com/entireio/cli) how to work with [Pi](https://pi.dev), the AI coding agent.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n| Capability | Status |\n|-----------|--------|\n| hooks | Yes — TypeScript extension in `.omp/extensions/entire/` |\n| transcript_analyzer | Yes — parses JSONL session files for prompts, files, summary |\n| token_calculator | Yes — sums token usage from assistant messages |\n| compact_transcript | Yes — emits Entire compact transcript JSONL for checkpoints v2 |\n\n## Installation\n\nBuild the binary and place it on your `PATH`:\n\n```bash\ncd agents/entire-agent-omp\ngo build -o entire-agent-omp ./cmd/entire-agent-omp\ncp entire-agent-omp /usr/local/bin/\n```\n\nOr use mise:\n\n```bash\ncd agents/entire-agent-omp\nmise run build\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [Pi](https://pi.dev) CLI installed (`omp` on PATH)\n- An LLM provider API key configured for Pi (e.g., `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`)\n\n## How It Works\n\n### Hooks\n\n`install-hooks` creates a TypeScript extension at `.omp/extensions/entire/index.ts` that intercepts Pi lifecycle events and forwards them to `entire agent hook pi <event>`:\n\n| Pi Event | Protocol Event |\n|----------|---------------|\n| `session_start` | SessionStart (type 1) |\n| `before_agent_start` | TurnStart (type 2) |\n| `agent_end` | TurnEnd (type 3) |\n| `session_shutdown` | (cleanup, no protocol event) |\n\n### Transcripts\n\nPi stores sessions as JSONL files at `~/.omp/agent/sessions/<encoded-path>/`. The binary reads these directly for transcript analysis, extracting:\n\n- Modified files from `write` and `edit` tool calls\n- User prompts from `role: \"user\"` messages\n- Summary from the last assistant text response\n- Token usage from assistant message `usage` fields\n\n### Session Management\n\nSession files are cached in `.entire/tmp/<session-id>.json` as required by the Entire protocol. The session ID is the UUID from the Pi session filename.\n\n## Development\n\n```bash\n# Build\ngo build -o entire-agent-omp ./cmd/entire-agent-omp\n\n# Unit tests\ngo test ./...\n\n# Protocol compliance\nexternal-agents-tests verify ./entire-agent-omp\n\n# E2E lifecycle tests (requires entire CLI and pi on PATH)\ncd ../../\nE2E_AGENT=omp mise run test:e2e\n```\n","numLines":78,"startLine":1,"totalLines":78}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"63be17c6-c65b-41e5-8d37-47a9e39a0033","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/georgf/src/entireio/external-agents/agents/entire-agent-omp","sessionId":"286761d2-ec70-4bd0-9106-a571f7d6d924","version":"2.1.123","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"e4831538-bda0-49d8-a925-12a5c46a6f2a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01St9PfZR9xF8Nvy6WBaNnAu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014Kyjj76tj8ZC3R9pzDUN1B","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/georgf/src/entireio/external-agents/agents/entire-agent-omp/README.md","content":"# entire-agent-omp\n\nExternal agent binary that teaches the [Entire CLI](https://github.com/entireio/cli) how to work with [oh-my-pi](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi) (`omp`), a fork of [pi-mono](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono) that ships its CLI as `omp`.\n\nThis wrapper is derived from `entire-agent-pi` and reuses its JSONL transcript parsing. oh-my-pi inherits pi-mono's session storage and extension API, so the format is broadly compatible. It has not been independently re-verified end-to-end against omp — see `AGENT.md`.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n| Capability | Status |\n|-----------|--------|\n| hooks | Yes — TypeScript extension in `.omp/extensions/entire/` |\n| transcript_analyzer | Yes — parses JSONL session files for prompts, files, summary |\n| token_calculator | Yes — sums token usage from assistant messages |\n| compact_transcript | Yes — emits Entire compact transcript JSONL for checkpoints v2 |\n\n## Installation\n\nBuild the binary and place it on your `PATH`:\n\n```bash\ncd agents/entire-agent-omp\ngo build -o entire-agent-omp ./cmd/entire-agent-omp\ncp entire-agent-omp /usr/local/bin/\n```\n\nOr use mise:\n\n```bash\ncd agents/entire-agent-omp\nmise run build\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [oh-my-pi](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi) CLI installed (`omp` on PATH; `npm install -g @oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent`)\n- An LLM provider API key configured for omp (e.g., `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`)\n\n## How It Works\n\n### Hooks\n\n`install-hooks` creates a TypeScript extension at `.omp/extensions/entire/index.ts` that intercepts omp lifecycle events and forwards them to `entire agent hook omp <event>`:\n\n| omp Event | Protocol Event |\n|----------|---------------|\n| `session_start` | SessionStart (type 1) |\n| `before_agent_start` | TurnStart (type 2) |\n| `agent_end` | TurnEnd (type 3) |\n| `session_shutdown` | (cleanup, no protocol event) |\n\n### Transcripts\n\nomp stores sessions as JSONL files under `~/.omp/agent/sessions/<encoded-path>/` (same scheme as pi-mono's `~/.pi/agent/`). The binary reads these directly for transcript analysis, extracting:\n\n- Modified files from `write` and `edit` tool calls\n- User prompts from `role: \"user\"` messages\n- Summary from the last assistant text response\n- Token usage from assistant message `usage` fields\n\n### Session Management\n\nSession files are cached in `.entire/tmp/<session-id>.json` as required by the Entire protocol. The session ID is the UUID from the omp session filename.\n\n## Development\n\n```bash\n# Build\ngo build -o entire-agent-omp ./cmd/entire-agent-omp\n\n# Unit tests\ngo test ./...\n\n# Protocol compliance\nexternal-agents-tests verify ./entire-agent-omp\n\n# E2E lifecycle tests (requires entire CLI and omp on PATH)\ncd ../../\nE2E_AGENT=omp mise run test:e2e\n```\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1612,"cache_read_input_tokens":149733,"output_tokens":1263,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1612,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1263,"cache_read_input_tokens":149733,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1612},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaZE7MCFw3ESBUV5HafXP","type":"assistant","uuid":"4a11859a-6b09-4ff9-a0e2-48524362c764","timestamp":"2026-04-30T03:14:13.676Z","userType":"e